  "description": "Sunhwa lives in a city lined with luxury apartment complexes. Feeling bored as a housewife, she visits 'Hwajung Sauna' on an acquaintance's recommendation, which is said to have excellent facilities and high customer satisfaction nearby. However, the sauna, which she was told was women-only, is packed with men… Dizzying desires unfold within the confined space of a sauna.\n\n*\"This shouldn't be happening... but I'm starting to feel good...\"*\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)",
